repository-code: 'https://github.com/c-beth/CaTSCAN'
abstract: >-
  CaTSCAN is an efficient algorithm for counting exact
  frequencies of typed graphlets of up to 5 nodes in
  heterogeneous information networks. It derives counts of
  larger graphlets from smaller ones using combinatorics,
  avoiding excessive enumeration while preserving type
  information.
keywords:
  - Subgraph counting
  - Heterogeneous networks
  - Graphlet
  - Motif Discovery
